stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    classDef deferred fill:#F2F2F0,stroke:#8A8A85,stroke-dasharray:5 3,color:#5A5A57

    [*] --> new : first message ·<br/>restaurant open ·<br/>orders not paused ·<br/>menu not empty and<br/>within 4,096 characters
    new --> browsing : same transaction (CAS):<br/>welcome and menu sent,<br/>with the last order<br/>when there is one

    browsing --> fulfillment_choice : finish word with a cart,<br/>or the reorder word<br/>with an empty cart ·<br/>restaurant delivers
    browsing --> cart_review : the same, when pickup is<br/>the only option or<br/>fulfilment is chosen

    fulfillment_choice --> cart_review : pickup, or a delivery<br/>address (1 to 300<br/>characters)
    fulfillment_choice --> browsing : edit (fulfilment cleared)<br/>or cancel (cart emptied)

    cart_review --> browsing : edit (fulfilment kept),<br/>cancel, or every line<br/>now unavailable
    cart_review --> order_placed : confirm word, every line<br/>available (CAS, then<br/>the order is written)

    browsing --> abandoned : next message after<br/>60 min of silence
    fulfillment_choice --> abandoned : next message after<br/>60 min of silence
    cart_review --> abandoned : next message after<br/>60 min of silence

    awaiting_payment
    class awaiting_payment deferred

    order_placed --> [*]
    abandoned --> [*]

    note right of new
        Orders paused (FR-28):
        in browsing, fulfilment
        and cart review every
        message gets the paused
        text, before any handler.
        No state changes and
        last_message_at is kept,
        so the customer resumes
        where they were.
    end note

    note left of browsing
        Item numbers, cart, menu
        and remove N stay in
        browsing.
        The reorder word (FR-08)
        fills an empty cart from
        the suggestion at
        today's prices, then
        does what the finish
        word does. Without a
        suggestion, or with a
        cart, it is read as
        ordinary text.
        Three messages in a row
        not understood: one
        handoff message with
        the restaurant's contact
        number; the state does
        not change.
    end note

    note right of awaiting_payment
        In the schema for online
        payment (deferred).
        Never entered today.
    end note

    note right of order_placed
        A closed state. The next
        message opens a new
        session with the welcome
        and the full menu.
    end note

    note right of abandoned
        No job: expiry is
        checked when the next
        message arrives, which
        then starts a new
        conversation. The
        abandoned session keeps
        its cart; no order
        is touched.
    end note
